Visit https://suppliers.multiquote.com then register and quote CA17733 as the reason for registration. 

 Any queries please contact MultiQuote on 0151 482 9230.', NULL, '2677d86b-76af-414c-8e96-e6ef5926ce88', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/1d6954c1-2bed-416f-b38f-25439979f7d7', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Construction work for sports facilities', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-05-29', '2026-05-01', '0fb3d02bf49f2749a79c4c81bc915e1fae4bf7567f516e91eec0ed03b6f46d3d') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
