      The consultant will be the lead designer and will coordinate separately with fire, IT and specialist systems. The consultant will also be responsible for coordinating with the survey teams and developing the model from point cloud data.', NULL, '3c0784f0-94f9-4d22-b4b7-d65240635bfa', (SELECT id FROM project_categories WHERE name = 'Cloud Migration'), 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 20000000, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/eb080f1b-38cc-4fe3-9c51-f1e8493fc2e9', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Engineering design services', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-05-14', '2026-05-07', 'b6bb6a333827014da706e7efd56ec45d1bbdb79dac5646e8dcd23f7900158857') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
