As part of its project activities, PFRU-2 is seeking an organization to supply specialized vehicles.', NULL, '5cbb1e9d-3c13-4a06-90e6-6489de48f97f', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 1, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/b60e90b3-86bc-4e82-a9a5-d8ac355d9919', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Transport equipment and auxiliary products to transportation', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-05-28', '2026-05-14', '6222d4bc756949167c95b1e74305a27753736c2cba3d4bca8f0a1eff568784f1') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
