Each display will be choreographed to music, incorporate flame and fire effects, and cater for audiences of up to 15,000 per night. The Authority is seeking a supplier with proven experience of delivering displays of comparable scale and complexity, alongside a clear commitment to safety, sustainability and the use of biodegradable pyrotechnic materials where practicable.', NULL, '25fa09db-1a23-43c3-94b7-8f3e39e4d113', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 250000, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/e9e3ce14-8fc1-4dbe-bb95-dbdc63434044', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Fireworks', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-06-16', '2026-05-15', '708f4c494614587c246f4bfd69236b6d938bd8002c14c078b8bed51bc1c615a2') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
