CPC will be using the MultiQuote e-Tendering platform to carry out this tender. In order to express your interest in this tender and obtain the tender documents, please register or log in at: https://suppliers.multiquote.com/Page/Login.aspx If you have any issues when using MultiQuote, please contact Elcom Ltd on 020 3920 8054 or email supplier@elcom.com


Includes Lots: 
Lot 1: Lot 1 - Human Resource Services
Lot 2: Lot 2 - Payroll Services
Lot 3: Lot 3 - Employee Screening Services 
Lot 4: Lot 4 - DBS Screening Services

To access this competition: 

