Login to https://suppliers.multiquote.com and view the opportunity CA17950.

Not registered:
Visit https://suppliers.multiquote.com then register and quote CA17950 as the reason for registration. 

 Any queries please contact MultiQuote on 020 3920 8054.', NULL, '2940fbe8-96b0-4894-a7d0-66c7b9a851ad', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 10000000, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/5d7b000c-f7ea-4e63-b25a-4d34b75c5606', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Business and management consultancy and related services', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-07-01', '2026-06-03', 'cd4c439328ae6a033b00d2a56ce557b3142c5e4bd4f252112b954fb7bfb75902') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
