To collect notes, coins and cheques from the Authorities sites in accordance with the schedule and deliver to the required destinations in North East & Cumbria.

To provide additional next day collections to existing sites upon request.

To provide ad hoc next day collections to existing sites upon request.

To provide collection and/or delivery to new sites upon request.

To transfer money between sites as required on a regular or ad hoc basis in line with the schedule, ensuring delivery at latest, next working day after collection.

