Lot 8: Lot 1H: Universities, Colleges, Large MAT''s, WPS - West Midlands
Lot 9: Lot 1I: Universities, Colleges, Large MAT''s, WPS - Yorkshire
Lot 10: Lot 1J: Universities, Colleges, Large MAT''s, WPS - England
Lot 11: Lot 1K: Universities, Colleges, Large MAT''s, WPS - Northern Ireland
Lot 12: Lot 1L: Universities, Colleges, Large MAT''s, WPS - Scotland
Lot 13: Lot 1M: Universities, Colleges, Large MAT''s, WPS - Wales
Lot 14: Lot 2A: Academies, Schools, Small MAT''s - East Anglia
Lot 15: Lot 2B: Academies, Schools, Small MAT''s - East Midlands

