Currently, we do not have any further information on this package but if you would like to be considered for this work, please complete an Expression of Interest form attached and return to jonty.hoffmeister@skanska.co.uk with the subject line of: "Expression of Interest - 1100.03 - V-Channel/Slipform - *Your Company Name*"', NULL, '337341b4-7dbb-464c-86b6-3d7ceaf79d28', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 1, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/a0e30b31-4b80-4025-aa26-5e49a29bdb9a', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Drainage system', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-07-07', '2026-06-16', '9a4b92d6ef80f50ddc9bff55c199dfab1c76f88d0fc6cec684e9cd40adbff7e3') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
