The supplier should be capable of installation, maintenance and testing of the Council''s current Christmas lights and equipment and also supply of new lights and equipment.

The supplier should be capable of supply and installation of power supply cabinets, bollards, or any other form of power supply to allow for the improvement of the installation system over the contract period if it proves necessary. 

The Christmas light display  is a continuation of the install of the Town Council owned display aside the requirement for supply and install new lights to the Town Hall building and a light to the top of the Christmas Tree.

