The Council is seeking bids that offer value for money through efficiency and innovative thinking, and Bidders will be required to identify the level of service (hours) that will be provided for the funds available. Nottinghamshire County Council wishes to appoint a single service provider. The scope and nature of the services required by the Council are set out in more detail in the Specification.', NULL, 'ca0474a8-02ae-47e0-b876-1b2a549e447a', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 710500, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/d7c297a7-ce2b-4166-96e4-5ee2f2c53575', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Social work and related services', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-08-04', '2026-07-06', 'ea71493f0068c162f95b1a8e1031530b4e549a7536736955007ada51f9561e4f') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO projects (id, reference_number, title, description, ai_summary, organization_id, category_id, source_id, country, state, budget_usd, currency, project_type, status, eligibility, official_link, contact_name, contact_email, contact_phone, tags, deadline, publication_date, source_hash) VALUES ('47220da3-8b93-4d2f-bc9c-a4a6be626e1b', 'ocds-b5fd17-29aea78a-589b-4b51-aeef-42714cbcaee6', 'INVITATION TO TENDER FOR PRINTING, PACKAGING, DELIVERY OF TEACHER LEARNING MATERIALS TO MALAWI', 'Montrose International has been contracted by the UK government Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO / the Client) to lead a consortium delivering technical assistance to the Malawi Ministry of Basic and Secondary Education (MoBSE) for Phase Two of the National Mathematics Curriculum Reform Programme (NMCRP). Montrose intends to procure a suitably qualified supplier to print, bind, pack and deliver learner workbooks and teacher guides for use in Malawi. The teacher learning materials to be printed have been reviewed and approved by the Ministry of Education. The anticipated scale remains substantial and may include approximately 3,823,387 learner workbooks and 40,547 teacher guides per school term, subject to confirmation at contract stage.', NULL, 'b137afb4-2aff-4019-bdbe-9ab8f5782ba3', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 2000000, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/108a2d62-afb0-4891-a9b9-f0b508d143ca', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['Printing and related services', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-08-14', '2026-07-06', 'e398e2a3a85f5232eafdfcb1baf762aba8b90f0f848c199f9555ca59123059e2') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
