To access this competition: 

Registered:
Login to https://suppliers.multiquote.com and view the opportunity CA18230.

Not registered:
Visit https://suppliers.multiquote.com then register and quote CA18230 as the reason for registration. 

 Any queries please contact MultiQuote on 020 3920 8054.', NULL, '49b7ef5d-686b-46c8-9f25-6538cc263dfe', NULL, 'b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, 10983213, 'GBP', 'Public Tender', 'Open', NULL, 'https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/5fa6a14f-d18b-48bd-bedf-bbd485a02408', NULL, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['School catering services', 'UK', 'Contracts Finder'], '2026-08-21', '2026-07-14', 'b7320bacb315bcc90052155ba93524c5e7f0aca8da6a599103582ed9540713ad') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
